; More complex expression in 2D notation
; (V0 + V1) * V2 => R0
;
; Notice how the 2D layout makes variable bindings clear:
; - Each V/Z/R in the expression row has its index directly below
; - Types are shown in the S row

 | ( V + V ) * V => R
V|    0   1       2      0
K|
S|    i   i       i      i

END
